# Dual platform (web + app)

When the user asks for dashboard / Advanced CRM / Lead Manager / Telecaller (or similar role) features:

1. **Implement on website** (`apps/web`) for the same roles (e.g. `TELECALLER` + `LEAD_MANAGER`).
2. **Make the web UI mobile-responsive** (phone + tablet layouts; touch-friendly; no desktop-only breakage).
3. **Implement the same feature on the mobile app** (`apps/mobile`) for those roles — same APIs, same capabilities (adapted to native UX).
4. Do not leave app behind unless the user explicitly says web-only.

Prefer shared APIs under `/api/telecaller/crm/...` (or existing role APIs) so web and app stay in sync.
